{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "c06d050aac3b41de1d2249056c118f2e36c40437596db751fc24dca7db2b4325", "ja": "笑顔はノーダウト", "zh": "笑容无可置疑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a1147d5b62edbced80b0da94943eb3d57cd85c9bdb7a841458eaf2ef8b2a04ff", "ja": "ついに迎えた卒業式当日。サプライズライブ\n本番が迫る中、プレッシャーを感じている様\n子の星梨花。環と茜、そしてプロデューサー\nに励まされ、いつものキラキラな笑顔を取り\n戻し、ステージへと向かうのだった。", "zh": "终于迎来了毕业典礼当天。惊喜演出的正式演出\n即将开始，星梨花似乎感受到了压力。\n在环、茜和制作人的鼓励下，她恢复了平日里闪耀的笑容，\n向着舞台走去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "81fa1bb6d88224ba35935ccc6faf1a9d352631aba0bf00884b77c12fa8cc4285", "ja": "（いよいよ、卒業式当日。頭上には、新しい門出に\nぴったりの、晴れ渡る空が広がっている……）", "zh": "（终于到了毕业典礼这天。头顶上是一片晴朗的天空，正适合迎接新的开始……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7e25ef0a47feecb3068bfb11b3e4a58d78971d005dab95a506617ce95f86275d", "ja": "みんな、そろそろ本番だけど、準備はどうだろう？\n段取りは頭に入ってるか？", "zh": "大家差不多要正式上场了，准备得怎么样？\n流程都记在脑子里了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "2d7daaf401be0d3ae2966ff112c7fe06e74c00f088f66e346ee4878616a44aaf", "ja": "ばっちりだぞ～♪　おやぶん見ててね、\nたまきたち、絶対に盛り上げちゃうから！", "zh": "准备得超完美～♪ 头儿，看好我们哦，\n环和大家绝对会把气氛炒热的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "b02290c49dba362f3d1b7cd6f35f56a85c1367c9becb130af6f86e2e0e2dcb46", "ja": "見える、見えるよ……盛り上がる生徒たちの姿が！\nこれは予想ではない……そう、確定された未来！", "zh": "我看到了，看到了……同学们嗨翻天的场面！\n这可不是预测……是已经确定了的未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "786988d7a38ce4dba2874e744e60abea9fda8da2b9ceabd1e0016644c7c9fe44", "ja": "ああ、よろしく頼むよ！　期待してるからな。", "zh": "啊，拜托你了！我很期待哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "1dde4f813551b80dbfc26602a2f97323881095c20f791673de9c3e16114cc960", "ja": "せりか、どうかしたの？　大丈夫？", "zh": "星梨花，怎么了？没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "8af2a7765abef4b42bf15e6b5548d6b5bea2072e4fa539e47c48f84030b23594", "ja": "あ……え、えへへ。ごめんなさい！\nわたし、ちょっと緊張しちゃってるのかもです……。", "zh": "啊……嘿、嘿嘿。对不起！\n我、我可能有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "beeb7ae0ffb63a689190e3c47832eafb823ee083aa0c7b2531af35f09984821e", "ja": "今日って、卒業するみなさんにとって、\n一生に一回しかない、大切な日なんですよね……。", "zh": "今天对即将毕业的大家来说，是一生只有一次的重要日子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a411cd9f0d035ca18979e892e3adc0aa498eaf3d6f61281551ddae7e9ff7102b", "ja": "そうだな。\nまあ……プレッシャーを感じるのも、わかるよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n不过……你会感到压力，我也能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "8d1efe0cdc09830d754d3e4ec6f7860e8a5d41d6a64fc97948271ab5768ebf38", "ja": "そっか……。\nねえねえ、せりか！　手を貸して！", "zh": "这样啊……。\n喂喂，星梨花！来帮我一把！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1011_se", "source_sha256": "211efcde593d6a541286d02026f8e20ded67917408d1d25349d35a3b3c8dd0e0", "ja": "ぎゅっ！", "zh": "抱紧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "7ea98d75095669015499425dc82581f234e55730b50662ae1087c397665533f9", "ja": "え？　……わっ。\n環ちゃん、すごく体温高いね……あったかい。", "zh": "咦？……哇。小环的体温好高啊……暖暖的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "66307d2def6aebd22bfe208eaf383593f16b94557a57a0e56d1502b7166e90e6", "ja": "ライブ前に手を繋いだら、安心できるでしょ？\nたまきがいるから、大丈夫だぞ～！", "zh": "演出开始前牵着手，就会安心了吧？\n因为有环在，没问题啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "48d1043d9abc40a858365b0ba7618daadb7c296056973470c5ea4159c2827cb1", "ja": "おやおや～？　茜ちゃんも混ぜてくれたまえ！\nっていうか勝手に混ざっちゃうよ、ニャハーッ☆", "zh": "哎呀哎呀～？也让小茜加入进来吧！\n不对不对，我会自己混进来的，喵哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1015_se", "source_sha256": "211efcde593d6a541286d02026f8e20ded67917408d1d25349d35a3b3c8dd0e0", "ja": "ぎゅっ！", "zh": "抱紧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "bd43b15a628806930586fb1a498f19da858fe612ca8007188de9b8392416b294", "ja": "あ……茜さんも。えへへ……♪", "zh": "啊……茜小姐也是。嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "317d8f9e0d28b433993df47d5a6860a5713fd0bdf99cb3c74b80912be531800d", "ja": "星梨花。緊張するのは、責任感の裏返しだから、\n悪いことだとは思わない。でも、笑顔は忘れないでな。", "zh": "星梨花。紧张是责任感的另一面，我不觉得这是坏事。\n不过，别忘了保持笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e3bc67f7fdad988e46581c5b403f960859b48409200763d06b5fa565132e84a6", "ja": "ファンは、星梨花の笑顔に会いたいんだ。\nそれは今日のステージだって、同じだと思うよ。", "zh": "粉丝们都想看到星梨花的笑容。\n我觉得，今天的舞台也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "8dabd1973caf6d6334162e10a5b91b9018c7e4b29fcdf290431d17b5578ff585", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nそうですよね、わたしがまず笑顔じゃないと。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n是啊，首先我得先保持笑容才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "1ca05fb72e1368c4626aadc7213e97a48e6f46dfe9aa606dffe00ee5c08c1508", "ja": "生徒さん達も、きっと笑ってくれませんよね。\nわたし、笑顔でがんばってきます！　にこっ♪", "zh": "学生们也一定不会笑吧。\n我会带着笑容加油的！　笑一个♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1021_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1022_koucho", "source_sha256": "d8cbb43cf3feadb199420e984ea16c1db78ceb56ad4647791666e2f52f480748", "ja": "え～、今日は卒業生の皆さんにとって、\nひとつの記念すべきアニバーサリーであり……えー。", "zh": "嗯～，今天对于各位毕业生来说，是一个值得纪念的周年纪念日……呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1024_koucho", "source_sha256": "02f2bb00507bdeca2a19948149f40886e87438b35559c521d2ae2ec6a7695c45", "ja": "皆さんにはこれから、光り輝く明日が待っています。\n明日という日はいつも、今日よりも未来だから……。", "zh": "等待着大家的，是光辉灿烂的明天。\n因为明天，无论何时都是比今天更加遥远的未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "07f1866becf53046fe95239555cfa7ea4ca3326bd45d81d02ab7bf7957c5dc3f", "ja": "ヘイヘイヘーイッ！　話が長いぜメーンッ！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿——！你说得太长啦，老兄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "7cf5a037dd1c934faa2df801b2a9acb33cfbf00b2c60195c491051da853dc89a", "ja": "カモーン、えぶりばでぃー！\nこの卒業式は、たまきたちがのっとった！", "zh": "来吧，大家——！\n这场毕业典礼已经被环和大家占领啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "3f28040a9615a7b7bdbc88861e27e02b8fe2d078c563d7e5d16107d132ad4708", "ja": "しぇけなべいびー！　今日はいい日～！\nみなさん、卒業おめでとうございます♪", "zh": "摇摆起来吧，宝贝！今天真是美好的一天～！\n祝大家毕业快乐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "fc0163409117d73a68efb35e23696d149d2eb30116590f63646fa047c6dfd4e3", "ja": "今すぐマイクを明け渡すんだ校長！\n今こそまさに茜ちゃんは絶好調！　イエァーッ！", "zh": "校长，赶紧把麦克风交出来！现在正是小茜状态绝佳之时！耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1030_koucho", "source_sha256": "32676dd876eb86ccc1b534264157d78563bf5405e76cc3d358189d5491a10991", "ja": "ライムの切れ味は一線級？\n今日という日に超センキュー！　……どうぞ。", "zh": "青柠的锋利程度是一流水准？  \n向今天这个日子道一声超级感谢！……给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1031_sotsugyoseitachi", "source_sha256": "bc0ef792f562c775fd74949125597f20179ae381406f594ea346a0af2884994d", "ja": "イエェェェーイッ！！", "zh": "耶——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_06_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "fed26ed0dff1d2edb0d1f6612fa326e7f2ee20a764749ffba1da3e2b4b8d4a3b", "ja": "よーしっ、いくぞーっ！　心のアンテナをチューン！\n最高にポップで、アッパーなフロアチューン……", "zh": "好～嘞，要上啦——！把心中的天线对准频率！\n最流行、最嗨的舞池金曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
